&lt;h4 id="securejson"&gt;SecureJSON&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SecureJSON prevents JSON hijacking. If the response is an array, it will prefix the output with &amp;ldquo;while(1)&amp;rdquo; by default.&lt;/p&gt;
